{"title": "Halfling Luck", "pageid": 3964, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Halfling_Luck", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Halfling_Luck.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Halfling_Luck.webp/300px-Halfling_Luck.webp, /w/images/9/9b/Halfling_Luck.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Halfling_Luck.webp/300px-Halfling_Luck.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Halfling_Luck.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Halfling Luck</b> is a passive feature in Baldur's Gate 3 which allows all halflings to reroll any (d20) dice once when it lands on a 1 for an Attack Roll, Ability Check, or Saving Throw.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you roll a 1 for an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, you can reroll the dice and must use the new roll. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halfling</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/%27Suspicious%27_Foont\" title=\"'Suspicious' Foont\">'Suspicious' Foont</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/%27Zinfandel%27_Gorse\" title=\"'Zinfandel' Gorse\">'Zinfandel' Gorse</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anderson\" title=\"Anderson\">Anderson</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arron\" title=\"Arron\">Arron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Babyjowls\" title=\"Babyjowls\">Babyjowls</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bad_Twin_Bubbins\" title=\"Bad Twin Bubbins\">Bad Twin Bubbins</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baz_Hopbank\" title=\"Baz Hopbank\">Baz Hopbank</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Beulla_Sandfoot\" title=\"Beulla Sandfoot\">Beulla Sandfoot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blades_Bakstir\" title=\"Blades Bakstir\">Blades Bakstir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bliggerillo\" title=\"Bliggerillo\">Bliggerillo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bloris_Meadhoney\" title=\"Bloris Meadhoney\">Bloris Meadhoney</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bramble\" title=\"Bramble\">Bramble</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brigand_Harrold\" title=\"Brigand Harrold\">Brigand Harrold</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brinn\" title=\"Brinn\">Brinn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brinna_Brightsong\" title=\"Brinna Brightsong\">Brinna Brightsong</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Burrock\" title=\"Burrock\">Burrock</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bustlebury\" title=\"Bustlebury\">Bustlebury</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chapeau\" title=\"Chapeau\">Chapeau</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cinna_Brewcellar\" title=\"Cinna Brewcellar\">Cinna Brewcellar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Highberry\" title=\"Cora Highberry\">Cora Highberry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Corliss_Undertump\" title=\"Corliss Undertump\">Corliss Undertump</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dashkent_Moliver\" title=\"Dashkent Moliver\">Dashkent Moliver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Halfling_(Ancient_Lair)\" title=\"Dead Halfling (Ancient Lair)\">Dead Halfling (Ancient Lair)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t-Call-Me-Runt\" title=\"Don't-Call-Me-Runt\">Don't-Call-Me-Runt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Doora_Thumbfoot\" title=\"Doora Thumbfoot\">Doora Thumbfoot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drana_Hoyte\" title=\"Drana Hoyte\">Drana Hoyte</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drussuvissill\" title=\"Drussuvissill\">Drussuvissill</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Edmundis_Magarus\" title=\"Edmundis Magarus\">Edmundis Magarus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elindale\" title=\"Elindale\">Elindale</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Falura\" title=\"Falura\">Falura</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fernhollow\" title=\"Fernhollow\">Fernhollow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fillip\" title=\"Fillip\">Fillip</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Findal\" title=\"Findal\">Findal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Flansy_Thornwhist\" title=\"Flansy Thornwhist\">Flansy Thornwhist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Freddo\" title=\"Freddo\">Freddo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fredrichk\" title=\"Fredrichk\">Fredrichk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Furbleston\" title=\"Furbleston\">Furbleston</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghulen\" title=\"Ghulen\">Ghulen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greymask\" title=\"Greymask\">Greymask</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Happy_Hoarson\" title=\"Happy Hoarson\">Happy Hoarson</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hector_Roba\" title=\"Hector Roba\">Hector Roba</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Huido\" title=\"Huido\">Huido</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Impurto_Nexim\" title=\"Impurto Nexim\">Impurto Nexim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ironfinger\" title=\"Ironfinger\">Ironfinger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jaryd\" title=\"Jaryd\">Jaryd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Khathi\" title=\"Khathi\">Khathi</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Korrinna_Koreena\" title=\"Korrinna Koreena\">Korrinna Koreena</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lanni\" title=\"Lanni\">Lanni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Linsella\" title=\"Linsella\">Linsella</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Loic\" title=\"Loic\">Loic</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lolo_Fuzzletoes\" title=\"Lolo Fuzzletoes\">Lolo Fuzzletoes</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Shattershield%27s_Bodyguard\" title=\"Lord Shattershield's Bodyguard\">Lord Shattershield's Bodyguard</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lugarrio\" title=\"Lugarrio\">Lugarrio</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mahrin\" title=\"Mahrin\">Mahrin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Regret_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Regret (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Regret (Overgrown Tunnel)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Miklaur\" title=\"Miklaur\">Miklaur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morgan\" title=\"Morgan\">Morgan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nonabune\" title=\"Nonabune\">Nonabune</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Olodan\" title=\"Olodan\">Olodan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ooltheg\" title=\"Ooltheg\">Ooltheg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pammella_Nortale\" title=\"Pammella Nortale\">Pammella Nortale</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pharbz\" title=\"Pharbz\">Pharbz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pheebs_Splayfoot\" title=\"Pheebs Splayfoot\">Pheebs Splayfoot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pinta\" title=\"Pinta\">Pinta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Randalf\" title=\"Randalf\">Randalf</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Robbin_Datherswick\" title=\"Robbin Datherswick\">Robbin Datherswick</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Roger_Gherkins\" title=\"Roger Gherkins\">Roger Gherkins</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Roger_Highberry\" title=\"Roger Highberry\">Roger Highberry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Scarpers\" title=\"Scarpers\">Scarpers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Slarmy\" title=\"Slarmy\">Slarmy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sleam\" title=\"Sleam\">Sleam</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sledge_Pettifeet\" title=\"Sledge Pettifeet\">Sledge Pettifeet</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Slorsha_Grommer\" title=\"Slorsha Grommer\">Slorsha Grommer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Slumgullion\" title=\"Slumgullion\">Slumgullion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stivvo\" title=\"Stivvo\">Stivvo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sylbert\" title=\"Sylbert\">Sylbert</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sylvie_Summerworth\" title=\"Sylvie Summerworth\">Sylvie Summerworth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Terse_Torvalt\" title=\"Terse Torvalt\">Terse Torvalt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Theda_Grosz\" title=\"Theda Grosz\">Theda Grosz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thindo_Vintervur\" title=\"Thindo Vintervur\">Thindo Vintervur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Three-Piece\" title=\"Three-Piece\">Three-Piece</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thyssa_Shineboot\" title=\"Thyssa Shineboot\">Thyssa Shineboot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tina_Two-Thumbs\" title=\"Tina Two-Thumbs\">Tina Two-Thumbs</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Trynn\" title=\"Trynn\">Trynn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tut_Thistlebog\" title=\"Tut Thistlebog\">Tut Thistlebog</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wren\" title=\"Wren\">Wren</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yannis\" title=\"Yannis\">Yannis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zeffy_Softbluff\" title=\"Zeffy Softbluff\">Zeffy Softbluff</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>It is possible for the new roll to be another 1.</li>\n<li>Halfling Luck is unique as a racial feature in that it cannot be replicated by <i><b>any</b></i> other item, spell, feat or ability in the unmodified version of the game. Although other racial features and abilities can be replaced (or at least approximated) by some methods, Halfling Luck has <i>no</i> such equivalent.</li>\n<li>As of patch 6, when rolling with advantage, the following rules apply:\n<ul><li>If one dice rolls a 1, it is re-rolled, and the higher of the two dice used.</li>\n<li>If both dice roll a 1, they are <b>both</b> re-rolled, and the highest of them is used.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The chance to hit displayed when hovering an attack on an enemy does not take into account Halfling Luck.</li>\n<li>Halfling Luck is particularly useful to avoid failures for ability checks and saving throws when the roll would only fail on a critical miss.\n<ul><li>On a normal roll that succeeds on a 2 or more, Halfling Luck reduces the chance to fail from 1/20 to 1/400.</li>\n<li>On a roll with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> that succeeds on a 2 or more, Halfling Luck reduces the chance to fail from 1/400 to 1/160,000, making it practically impossible to fail. With <a href=\"/wiki/Karmic_Dice\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Karmic Dice\">Karmic Dice</a> active, it may be simply impossible to roll 4 critical failures in a row.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lucky\" title=\"Lucky\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/20px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/30px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/40px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lucky\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/20px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lucky\" title=\"Lucky\">Lucky</a> is one way to consistently obtain advantage on almost any roll, as such it (arguably) pairs well with this passive.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Halflings can pilfer all <a href=\"/wiki/Steal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Steal\">easy-to-steal</a> items from traders without fear of missing a single roll.\n<ul><li>Be mindful that uninterrupted stealing can make the character <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Encumbered (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Encumbered\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Heavily_Encumbered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Encumbered_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Encumbered (Condition)\">Heavily Encumbered</a> which gives <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on all ability checks, including further pickpocket attempts.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Stealth checks can get pretty much guaranteed to succeed.</li>\n<li>This passive greatly reduces incidents of <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> interruptions which result from constitution save critical misses when taking low damage.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When rolling a 1 on an <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack roll</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">ability check</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throw</a>, rerolls once and uses the new result.</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math\">Math</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chances_of_succeeding_a_specific_roll\">Chances of succeeding a specific roll</span></h3>\n<p>See <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage#Math\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage math section</a> for comparison.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Chance of rolling a target number or above on 1d20 with Halfling Luck\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Target on 1d20</th>\n<th>Luck Normal Roll</th>\n<th>Luck with Advantage</th>\n<th>Luck with Disadvantage\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>99.75%</td>\n<td>99.9994%</td>\n<td>99.5%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>94.50%</td>\n<td>99.7%</td>\n<td>89.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>89.25%</td>\n<td>98.84%</td>\n<td>79.66%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>84%</td>\n<td>97.44%</td>\n<td>70.56%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>78.75%</td>\n<td>95.48%</td>\n<td>62.02%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>73.5%</td>\n<td>92.98%</td>\n<td>54.02%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>68.25%</td>\n<td>89.92%</td>\n<td>46.58%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>63%</td>\n<td>86.31%</td>\n<td>39.69%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>57.75%</td>\n<td>82.15%</td>\n<td>33.35%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>52.5%</td>\n<td>77.44%</td>\n<td>27.56%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>47.25%</td>\n<td>72.17%</td>\n<td>22.33%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>42%</td>\n<td>66.36%</td>\n<td>17.64%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>36.75%</td>\n<td>59.99%</td>\n<td>13.51%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>31.5%</td>\n<td>53.08%</td>\n<td>9.92%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>26.25%</td>\n<td>45.61%</td>\n<td>6.89%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>21%</td>\n<td>37.59%</td>\n<td>4.41%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>15.75%</td>\n<td>29.02%</td>\n<td>2.48%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>10.5%</td>\n<td>19.9%</td>\n<td>1.1%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>5.25%</td>\n<td>10.22%</td>\n<td>0.28%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Luck.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Luck.png/300px-Luck.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Luck.png/450px-Luck.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Luck.png/600px-Luck.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Luck.png/300px-Luck.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Luck.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chance_to_hit_comparisons\">Chance to hit comparisons</span></h3>\n<p>On a normal roll, Halfling Luck multiplies the chance to hit by&nbsp;:\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.05 whatever the target roll is\n<ul><li>This would be the most noticeable for a target roll of 2 which would add a flat 4.75% chance to hit or almost +1 on a d20.</li>\n<li>For a target roll of 20 it would add a flat 0.25% chance to hit, which would be a critical success.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>On a roll with Advantage, Halfling Luck multiplies the chance to hit by&nbsp;:\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.003 for a target roll of 2 or a flat +0.25% chance to hit</li>\n<li>1.01 for a target roll of 3 or a flat +0.70% chance to hit</li></ul>\n<p>...\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.03 for a target roll of 11 or a flat +2.44% chance to hit</li></ul>\n<p>...\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.05 for a target roll of 20 or a flat +0.47% chance to hit, which would be a critical success.</li></ul>\n<p>On a roll with Disadvantage, Halfling Luck multiplies the chance to hit by&nbsp;:\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.10 whatever the target roll is\n<ul><li>This would be the most noticeable for a target roll of 2 which would add a flat 9.25% chance to hit or almost +2 on a d20.</li>\n<li>For a target roll of 20 it would add a flat 0.03% chance to hit, which would be a critical success.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chance_to_fail_comparisons\">Chance to fail comparisons</span></h3>\n<p>On a normal roll, Halfling Luck divides the chance to fail by&nbsp;:\n</p>\n<ul><li>20 for a target roll of 2</li>\n<li>1.82 for a target roll of 3</li>\n<li>1.40 for a target roll of 4</li></ul>\n<p>...\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.003 for a target roll of 20</li></ul>\n<p>On a roll with Advantage, Halfling Luck divides the chance to fail by&nbsp;: \n</p>\n<ul><li>400 for a target roll of 2</li>\n<li>3.31 for a target roll of 3</li>\n<li>1.95 for a target roll of 4</li></ul>\n<p>...\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.01 for a target roll of 20</li></ul>\n<p>On a roll with Disadvantage, Halfling Luck divides the chance to fail by&nbsp;: \n</p>\n<ul><li>19.52 for a target roll of 2</li>\n<li>1.78 for a target roll of 3</li>\n<li>1.36 for a target roll of 4</li></ul>\n<p>...\n</p>\n<ul><li>1.0003 for a target roll of 20</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ebI3SACmQFpC82tSN5UOQEI4HwizHDOPZDofTJqh9Hs\">Advantage and Halfling luck calculation</a> by Kalaeman</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200443\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1690/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16263/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11394/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6124/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 828933/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.421      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   57.421      1 -total\n 28.91%   16.602      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 28.60%   16.422      7 Template:Icon_text\n 23.45%   13.465     14 Template:Trim\n 15.17%    8.713      7 Template:Ifempty\n 14.86%    8.531      1 Template:Attack_Roll\n 11.26%    6.468      4 Template:Icon_link\n 10.87%    6.244      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.49%    5.448      2 Template:SmSAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3964-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200443 and revision id 374493. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}